  {
   "id": 25,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    -1020,
    0
   ],
   "size": [
    460,
    560
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 24,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# 12 - Full character replacement and object / background editing (whole frame)\n\n**Models** (official Comfy-Org files; the loaders carry their download links): ref2va, Qwen3-VL, video + audio VAE.\n\n**Checkpoint variants**: the bf16 checkpoints work in the same loaders (pick them in the list); the Turbo LoRA (4-step ref2v / 8-step fl2v) cuts the steps - set the scheduler steps to match.\n\n**Inputs**: the plate, a mask video of the character / object (white = edit), <Picture 1> the new look. Set Image + Reference's width / height / length to the plate's.\n\n**Controls**: whole frame, no crop (for subjects that fill the frame, objects, backgrounds); Invert Mask (bypassed) - enable it to edit the BACKGROUND around the masked subject; Source AV Latent pads an off-grid plate at the right / bottom (recorded) instead of the VAE's silent centre crop; Image Composite Masked keeps every pixel outside the mask from the plate.\n\n**Output**: the edited plate with its own sound, MP4.\n\n**Limits**: whole-frame generation at the plate's size: large plates are slow (use workflow 4 / 7 crops for a small subject); the plate length must be 17k+5 frames.\n\n**Status**: built in ComfyUI's own front end and validated by the server (only missing model / media files reported). NOT run on H3 weights on the build machine - starting values follow core's H3 templates (res_multistep, simple, 20 steps, guider cfg 1). Guide: workflows/tasks/README.md."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "# 12 - Full character replacement and object / background editing (whole frame)\n\n**Models** (official Comfy-Org files; the loaders carry their download links): ref2va, Qwen3-VL, video + audio VAE.\n\n**Checkpoint variants**: the bf16 checkpoints work in the same loaders (pick them in the list); the Turbo LoRA (4-step ref2v / 8-step fl2v) cuts the steps - set the scheduler steps to match.\n\n**Inputs**: the plate, a mask video of the character / object (white = edit), <Picture 1> the new look. Set Image + Reference's width / height / length to the plate's.\n\n**Controls**: whole frame, no crop (for subjects that fill the frame, objects, backgrounds); Invert Mask (bypassed) - enable it to edit the BACKGROUND around the masked subject; Source AV Latent pads an off-grid plate at the right / bottom (recorded) instead of the VAE's silent centre crop; Image Composite Masked keeps every pixel outside the mask from the plate.\n\n**Output**: the edited plate with its own sound, MP4.\n\n**Limits**: whole-frame generation at the plate's size: large plates are slow (use workflow 4 / 7 crops for a small subject); the plate length must be 17k+5 frames.\n\n**Status**: built in ComfyUI's own front end and validated by the server (only missing model / media files reported). NOT run on H3 weights on the build machine - starting values follow core's H3 templates (res_multistep, simple, 20 steps, guider cfg 1). Guide: workflows/tasks/README.md."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
 ],
